d="section-6" data-index="06"><h2>6. Equipment and accounts</h2><p>Customers must use gaming equipment carefully and follow staff instructions. Ace Gaming may charge for intentional damage or damage caused by reckless misuse, where permitted. Customers are responsible for signing out of personal gaming accounts and protecting their own passwords and digital purchases.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-7" data-index="07"><h2>7. Games, connectivity and performance</h2><p>Game availability, updates, online services, internet connectivity and third-party servers may change or become temporarily unavailable. Ace Gaming will make reasonable efforts to provide the booked experience but cannot control external platforms or game servers.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-8" data-index="08"><h2>8. Food, allergies and belongings</h2><p>Customers should inform staff about relevant allergies before ordering food. Personal belongings remain the customer’s responsibility. Ace Gaming is not responsible for loss or damage except where liability cannot legally be excluded.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-9" data-index="09"><h2>9. Website and intellectual property</h2><p>The Ace Gaming name, visual design, website content and original materials may not be copied, resold or used to impersonate the business without permission. Customers may use the website only for lawful personal booking and information purposes.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-10" data-index="10"><h2>10. Liability</h2><p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Ace Gaming is not liable for indirect or consequential loss, third-party service failures, interrupted gameplay or loss of personal data from a customer’s own account. Nothing in these terms limits rights or liabilities that cannot legally be limited.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-11" data-index="11"><h2>11. Changes and suspension</h2><p>We may update services, packages, operating rules or these terms. We may refuse, pause or cancel a booking where necessary for safety, maintenance, suspected misuse, non-payment or circumstances outside reasonable control.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-12" data-index="12"><h2>12. Governing law</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Courts with jurisdiction over Ace Gaming’s operating location will handle disputes unless applicable law requires a different process.</p></section><section class="legal-section" id="section-13" data-index="13"><h2>13. Contact</h2><div class="contact-card"><p>Questions about these terms or a booking can be sent on WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/919076060602" rel="noopener" target="_blank">+91 90760 60602</a>.</p></div></section>
